<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "日常.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\なつみの教室.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"A 90, huh. I was sure I'd get a perfect score..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, hey, </STYLE>Niimura-san<STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Hm?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That last test was so hard, I don't get it at all even looking at the answers..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">―Sorry, but could you go over the geography test with us...?</STYLE><PG>
"Yeah, sure. But I got quite a few wrong too, so..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Niimura-san<STYLE ID="1">, you're good at geography, and you still got that many wrong?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">―Even </STYLE>Niimura-san<STYLE ID="1"> did badly, so it really was fiendish... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
Niimura-san<STYLE ID="1">, how do you study geography?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Hmm... I look at maps online, I guess. 
{PAUSE ""}
It's not studying exactly, but when I'm bored, I often look at maps on the computer and go around seeing the whole world!
{PAUSE ""}
　It's pretty fun!"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hmm, is it that fun?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"When you look at Street View and stuff, it feels like you're traveling in that country. 
{PAUSE ""}
And then, whatever catches your interest, you look it up online right there, and before you know it you've picked up the knowledge. 
{PAUSE ""}
Take classes in that state, and it slides right into your head!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">―Your way of studying is a little different from ours...</STYLE><PG>
"Ha ha ha, I only get good grades in humanities subjects other than English. English and the sciences are mostly below average!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Niimura-san<STYLE ID="1">, you're the type who excels at one thing!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">―Narrow, but deep, that kind of thing?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"But, you can't hold your own in university entrance exams with just Japanese and social studies. 
{PAUSE ""}
I think it's about time I did something about English and stuff, but..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"But, </STYLE>Niimura-san<STYLE ID="1">, you're close with that </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">genius girl</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, right?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　I heard she's enrolling here soon; can't she tutor you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Hmm, <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE>, huh. 
{PAUSE ""}
I think if I asked, she'd teach me as much as I want, but it feels bad to rely on <STYLE ID="3">her</STYLE> all the time. 
{PAUSE ""}
Besides, <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE> eats a crazy amount, so if I treated her at Zahha as thanks, my wallet would be empty... 
{PAUSE ""}
Going to cram school would be way more economical."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">―So the </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">genius girl</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s tutoring fee really isn't cheap...</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
;---------------------------------------
; END DECOMPILED SCRIPT
